Queue<Integer> queue = new LinkedList<>();

boolean[] visited = new boolean[n];

queue.add(start);
visited[start] = true;

while (!queue.isEmpty()) {

    int node = queue.poll();

    for (int neighbor : graph.get(node)) {

        if (!visited[neighbor]) {

            visited[neighbor] = true;
            queue.add(neighbor);
        }
    }
}

START
  ↓
Put node in Queue
  ↓
Mark visited
  ↓
Take node from Queue
  ↓
Get its neighbors
  ↓
If not visited
  ↓
Mark visited
  ↓
Put neighbor in Queue
  ↓
Repeat



